        {
          "id": 675284691,
          "type": null,
          "body": "added 4 commits\n\n<ul><li>b43ca05c...9fcc11cc - 3 commits from branch <code>wireshark:master</code></li><li>02b18b7e - Qt: &quot;Jackpot mode&quot; for related-packet indicators.</li></ul>\n\n[Compare with previous version](/wireshark/wireshark/-/merge_requests/4170/diffs?diff_id=243980821&start_sha=b43ca05c80e845c28439397fc26e03daedf7ac0a)",
